OL,3,GNEWSAWork to restore 1,000-year-old
OL,4,Awatermill begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major conservation project has
OL,7,Fstarted at a watermill that dates back
OL,8,Fmore than 1,000 years.
OL,10,FThe #120,000 project at Houghton Mill,
OL,11,Fon the River Great Ouse near
OL,12,FHuntingdon, Cambridgeshire, will
OL,13,Fsafeguard the site for years to come,
OL,14,Fthe National Trust said.
OL,16,FThe charity, which owns the site, said
OL,17,Fit hoped work would be completed by
OL,18,FJanuary so the mill could reopen by
OL,19,FEaster.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
